ozzle 8–10 cm from skin; slow sweeps across face.", "step_number": "7", "ingredients_equipments": ["Hydrafacial Machine", "Oxygen Injection (Hydra spray)"]}, {"duration": "7 minutes", "how_to_do": "Apply HA gel thinly and infuse with face ultrasound probe in circular motions (cheeks, forehead, chin). For under-eyes, use ocular probe with TRX A confined to infraorbital area; keep 0.5–1 cm away from lash line; continuous gliding with gel.", "step_number": "8", "ingredients_equipments": ["Face Ultrasound Infusion Probe", "Hyaluronic Acid", "Ocular Ultrasound Infusion Probe", "TRX A (Tranexamic Acid)"]}, {"duration": "12 minutes", "how_to_do": "Blue LED for 6 minutes (acne bacteria, 10–15 cm distance) followed by Red LED for 6 minutes (healing). Maintain eye shields; stop if warmth is uncomfortable.", "step_number": "9", "ingredients_equipments": ["LED Light Therapy Machine"]}, {"duration": "10 minutes", "how_to_do": "Apply a uniform layer avoiding eyelids and nostrils; allow to set; peel off upward.", "step_number": "10", "ingredients_equipments": ["peelOffMasks: Hydrate"]}, {"duration": "4 minutes", "how_to_do": "Finish: pat HA serum, seal with moisturizer, then apply broad-spectrum sunscreen. This satisfies the mandatory Serum + Moisturizer + Sunscreen requirement.", "step_number": "11", "ingredients_equipments": ["Hyaluronic Acid (serum)", "Hydrating Gel Base (moisturizer)", "Sunscreen SPF 50"]}]',
