            'preparations_checklist_for_therapist' => '["Confirm no photosensitizing drugs; allergies: none reported; sun exposure <1 hr → Q-Switch allowed.", "Obtain consent for Q-Switch Carbon procedure; explain mild snaps and smell of carbon burn-off.", "Cleanse face; remove oils with Alcohol Swabs on T-zone before laser stage.", "Prepare Hydrafacial Machine with Suction Probe / Bubble Pen and Cutin Removal Spatula; load Hydrafacial Serum SA2 (Oil Control).", "Keep Manual Comedone Extractor and Loop Extractor sterilized; Gauze Pads and Cotton Pads ready.", "Set High-Frequency Machine for post-extraction sanitation (low to medium intensity).", "Preload Q-Switch Laser: wavelength 1064nm; start energy 600 mJ; frequency 6 Hz; eye shields ready.", "Set LED Light Therapy Machine: Blue mode 8 min then Red mode 6 min.", "Prepare Jet/Ultrasound Infusion: Face Ultrasound Infusion Probe + TRX A (Tranexamic Acid) and Hyaluronic Acid.", "Mask station: Brighten peel-off mask; Hydrating Gel Base + pH Neutral Gel for massage/ultrasound slip.", "Mandatory finishers at end: Serum (Hyaluronic Acid), Moisturizer, Sunscreen.", "Maintain cool air and patient comfort; stop if excessive erythema, burning, or wheal formation is noted."]',
